  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": "<p>Integration tests which use the imagemanip service fail when FeSL is enabled. Call to the imagemanip service hang until eventually timing out.</p>\n\n<p>With FeSL enabled, an individual request to<br/>\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/imagemanip/ImageManipulation?op=resize&amp;newWidth=50&amp;url=http://localhost:8080/tomcat.gif\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/imagemanip/ImageManipulation?op=resize&amp;newWidth=50&amp;url=http://localhost:8080/tomcat.gif</a><br/>\nhangs and eventually times out.</p>\n\n<p>Workarounds for imagemanip:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>remove fedora.war</li>\n\t<li>disable fesl</li>\n\t<li>comment out calls to PopulatePolicyDatabase.addDocuments(); and pdp = new PDP(config.getDefaultPDPConfig()); in MelcoePDPImpl</li>\n</ul>\n",
  "duedate": null,
